      "body": "Hi! I'd like to take this.\n\nI plan to reuse the existing adaptive-sidebar state and change only the first Browser-open behavior: keep the sidebar visible, reduce it to the existing 200px minimum once per app session, and preserve all later manual resizing or closing. I'll add focused store/SessionView tests and verify the behavior in Electron.\n\nI also noticed that PR #4699 touches the nearby compact-sidebar surface. Should this work be based after that PR lands?\n",
