    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "## Problem\n\nPR #4379 introduced smooth expansion of the Browser inspector on the right by closing the left sidebar when Browser is opened. Completely closing the left sidebar removes useful session navigation.\n\n## Desired behavior\n\n- Preserve the existing smooth right-side Browser expansion from #4379.\n- On the first Browser open in an app session, shrink the left sidebar to AO's existing minimum width (currently 200px) instead of closing it.\n- Apply this automatic resize only once per app session.\n- Subsequent Browser opens in the same app session should not automatically resize the left sidebar.\n- Preserve the user's ability to resize or close the sidebar manually.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Browser expansion remains smooth and behaves as it does today.\n- The left sidebar remains visible at 200px after the first Browser open.\n- The automatic minimization occurs once per app session, not once per project or AO session.\n- Existing sidebar and Browser resizing behavior remains unchanged otherwise.",
